      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.35,
      "end_seconds": 11.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.56,
      "end_seconds": 15.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "It's a high fever, mostly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.44,
      "end_seconds": 21.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "So, how many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.45,
      "end_seconds": 24.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "About... well, two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.59,
      "end_seconds": 31.34,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Right, is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.33,
      "end_seconds": 34.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "It just comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.81,
      "end_seconds": 37.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.56,
      "end_seconds": 52.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.97,
      "text": "It usually comes with pain much worse than it looks. The pain much worse than it looks? That's been for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.62,
      "end_seconds": 71.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.57,
      "end_seconds": 76.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Yeah, I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.96,
      "end_seconds": 80.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.12,
      "end_seconds": 83.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "No, none."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.82,
      "end_seconds": 101.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.79,
      "end_seconds": 107.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Not really, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.27,
      "end_seconds": 120.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.54,
      "end_seconds": 129.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.53,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.52,
      "end_seconds": 135.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "So, what about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.61,
      "end_seconds": 141.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Okay, so my father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.96,
      "end_seconds": 145.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.57,
      "end_seconds": 151.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "I had my septum straightened in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.24,
      "end_seconds": 164.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Any cut or insect bite at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.57,
      "end_seconds": 173.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.38,
      "end_seconds": 177.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.96,
      "end_seconds": 181.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.05,
      "end_seconds": 184.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.87,
      "end_seconds": 198.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.29,
      "end_seconds": 226.95,
      "duration_seconds": 12.66,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 119 over 67, pulse 97, temperature is 38.7 degrees. Listening to the whole story, my working impression is a severe deep skin infection needing urgent surgery review."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.9,
      "end_seconds": 231.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.74,
      "end_seconds": 252.7,
      "duration_seconds": 20.96,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a severe deep skin infection needing urgent surgery review do well once it's treated properly. Let's book urgent blood tests to look into severe skin infection. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 254.57,
      "end_seconds": 258.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "We have a slot Wednesday at 9 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.28,
      "end_seconds": 279.22,
      "duration_seconds": 18.94,
      "text": "Let's book an urgent surgical review to look into possible necrotising infection. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. I am sending you to hospital now, do not wait. We'll refer you to the surgical team."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.39,
      "end_seconds": 284.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.76,
      "end_seconds": 291.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Do get help quickly if you cannot go now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.46,
      "end_seconds": 297.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.61,
      "end_seconds": 306.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "Let's plan a check straight away. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.05,
      "end_seconds": 310.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
